{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"Picard 群"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"Picard群"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>空间的 <strong>Picard 叠</strong>是其上"},{"Local":{"url":"线丛","text":"线丛"}},{"Plain":" (即 "},{"Local":{"url":"乘法群概形","text":"$\\mathbb{G}_m$"}},{"Plain":"-"},{"Local":{"url":"主丛","text":"主丛"}},{"Plain":") 的"},{"Local":{"url":"模空间","text":"模空间"}},{"Plain":",\n$$\r\n\\mathrm{Pic}(X) = \\operatorname{Maps}(X,\\mathbf{B}\\mathbb{G}_m);\r\n$$\n<strong>Picard 群</strong>是 Picard 叠的 $0$-"},{"Local":{"url":"截断性(同伦类型论)","text":"截断"}},{"Plain":", 即线丛的同构类关于张量积构成的群.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>复流形</h3>\n<p>紧复流形 $M$ 的 Picard 群 $\\text{Pic}(M)$ 是"},{"Local":{"url":"全纯线丛","text":"全纯线丛"}},{"Plain":"的同构类关于张量积构成的群. $\\text{Pic}(M)$ 的单位元是平凡丛, 也即全纯函数层 $\\mathcal O_M$.</p>\n<p>定义 $\\text{Pic}^0(M)$ 为 $\\text{Pic}(M)$ 中由第一"},{"Local":{"url":"陈类","text":"陈类"}},{"Plain":"等于零的线丛构成的子群.</p>\n<h3>概形</h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"概形","text":"概形"}},{"Plain":" (或"},{"Local":{"url":"环化空间","text":"环化空间"}},{"Plain":") $X$ 的 Picard 群 $\\operatorname{Pic}(X)$ 是 $X$ 上秩为 $1$ 的局部自由 $\\mathcal O_X$-模的同构类在张量积下构成的群. 它也同构于"},{"Local":{"url":"平展上同调","text":"平展上同调"}},{"Plain":" $H^1(X_{\\mathrm{\\'et}},\\mathbb G_m)$.</p>\n<h3>对称幺半范畴</h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"对称幺半范畴","text":"对称幺半范畴"}},{"Plain":"的 Picard 群是其中可逆对象的同构类构成的 Abel 群.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>$\\text{Pic}(M) \\simeq H^1(M,\\mathcal O_M^*)$.</p>\n<p>$\\text{Pic}^0(M) \\simeq H^1(M,\\mathcal O_M) / H^1(M,\\mathbb{Z})$. (参见"},{"Local":{"url":"指数序列","text":"指数序列"}},{"Plain":")</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Dedekind整环","text":"Dedekind 整环"}},{"Plain":"的谱的 Picard 群是这个环的"},{"Local":{"url":"理想类群","text":"理想类群"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}